<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1741965409"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:58.695"><div begin="19.403" end="39.736" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.403" end="21.860" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.403" end="20.154">黑马</span><span begin="20.154" end="21.142">奔向那个事外</span><span begin="21.142" end="21.860">桃源</span></p><p begin="21.870" end="24.649" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.870" end="22.259">说</span><span begin="22.259" end="22.972">它命不由</span><span begin="22.972" end="23.614">天不</span><span begin="23.614" end="24.649">要再蒙着眼</span></p><p begin="25.015" end="27.437" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.015" end="25.662">孤独</span><span begin="25.662" end="26.755">向来都是雪上</span><span begin="26.755" end="27.437">加盐</span></p><p begin="27.447" end="30.387" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.447" end="27.844">若</span><span begin="27.844" end="28.536">能视而不</span><span begin="28.536" end="29.197">见方</span><span begin="29.197" end="30.387">可攻其不备</span></p><p begin="30.583" end="39.736" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.583" end="32.502">缰绳总会言之</span><span begin="32.502" end="33.056">有</span><span begin="33.056" end="34.185">理的出现</span> <span begin="34.363" end="35.292">用各种</span><span begin="35.292" end="36.192">大众</span><span begin="36.192" end="36.540">语</span><span begin="36.540" end="39.736">言</span></p></div><div begin="41.707" end="56.771" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.707" end="44.270" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.707" end="42.452">黑马</span><span begin="42.452" end="43.453">路过村庄路过</span><span begin="43.453" end="44.270">草原</span></p><p begin="44.280" end="47.086" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.280" end="44.576">能</span><span begin="44.576" end="45.288">躲雨的屋</span><span begin="45.288" end="45.968">檐出</span><span begin="45.968" end="47.086">于本性留恋</span></p><p begin="47.321" end="49.711" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.321" end="48.001">不问</span><span begin="48.001" end="49.023">前程或许能走</span><span begin="49.023" end="49.711">更远</span></p><p begin="49.721" end="52.644" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.721" end="50.806">最好无路可</span><span begin="50.806" end="51.510">退自</span><span begin="51.510" end="52.217">然心无杂</span><span begin="52.217" end="52.644">念</span></p><p begin="52.894" end="56.771" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.894" end="53.495">造旷</span><span begin="53.495" end="54.755">世免不了</span> <span begin="54.755" end="55.607">自己</span><span begin="55.607" end="56.771">挥的鞭</span></p></div><div begin="58.363" end="1:26.090" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.363" end="1:02.583" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.363" end="59.175">你骄傲的存</span><span begin="59.175" end="1:00.368">在 在</span><span begin="1:00.368" end="1:00.793">百</span><span begin="1:00.793" end="1:01.241">年之</span><span begin="1:01.241" end="1:01.871">外</span><span begin="1:01.871" end="1:02.583">也醒着</span></p><p begin="1:03.847" end="1:08.285" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.847" end="1:04.750">你骄傲的存</span><span begin="1:04.750" end="1:05.955">在 在</span><span begin="1:05.955" end="1:06.392">败</span><span begin="1:06.392" end="1:06.845">了也</span><span begin="1:06.845" end="1:07.263">值</span><span begin="1:07.263" end="1:08.285">得</span></p><p begin="1:09.501" end="1:13.685" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.501" end="1:10.310">你骄傲的存</span><span begin="1:10.310" end="1:11.619">在 在</span><span begin="1:11.619" end="1:11.989">百</span><span begin="1:11.989" end="1:12.141">年</span><span begin="1:12.141" end="1:12.969">之外</span><span begin="1:12.969" end="1:13.685">也活着</span></p><p begin="1:15.072" end="1:19.437" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.072" end="1:15.935">你骄傲的存</span><span begin="1:15.935" end="1:17.179">在 再</span><span begin="1:17.179" end="1:17.633">来已</span><span begin="1:17.633" end="1:18.379">是伯</span><span begin="1:18.379" end="1